  "paths": {
    "/v1/responses": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "对话生成"
        ],
        "summary": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Responses 接口（OpenAI 兼容）",
        "description": "**预览版模型**：MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 目前为预览版，行为和参数可能会发生变化。\n\n- 使用 OpenAI Responses 协议调用 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash\n- **输入形态**：`input` 可以是一段纯文本，也可以是输入项数组（消息、函数调用、函数结果、思考）\n- **多模态输入**：用户消息支持 `input_image` 和 `input_video` 内容块\n- **系统指令**：通过 `instructions` 下达，等价于首条 system 消息\n- **思考模式**：始终开启，通过 `reasoning.effort` 设置思考深度。`output` 数组以 `reasoning` 项（`reasoning_text`）开头，随后是 `message` 项（`output_text`）\n- **流式输出**：SSE 事件；回答文本通过 `response.output_text.delta` 事件返回，生成以 `response.completed`（或 `response.incomplete` / `response.failed`）结束\n- **工具调用**：支持 Function Calling\n\n**思考与输出 token 上限**：\n- 思考无法关闭。推理 token 按输出 token 计费，计入 `max_output_tokens`，并在 `usage.output_tokens_details.reasoning_tokens` 中统计\n- 未设置 `max_output_tokens` 时，EvoLink 默认使用 **32768**\n- 上限较小而思考深度较高时，思考可能占满整个上限：响应以 `status: \"incomplete\"`（`incomplete_details.reason: \"max_output_tokens\"`）结束，且没有 `message` 项。建议将上限保持在 32768 及以上，简单任务可调低 `reasoning.effort`\n- 多轮工具调用时，请将上一轮响应的 `output` 项（包括 `reasoning` 和 `function_call` 项）原样加入 `input`，再追加你的 `function_call_output` 项\n\n**兼容规则**：\n\n| 请求 | EvoLink 处理方式 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `reasoning.effort: \"none\"` / `\"minimal\"` | 改为 `low`；思考仍会进行，并按输出计费 |\n| `service_tier` | 移除；请求始终按标准服务层级处理 |\n| `previous_response_id` / `conversation` | 不支持：请求会被拒绝并返回 400（`unsupported_parameter`），请在 `input` 中携带完整历史 |\n| `store` | 不生效；响应不会被保存 |\n| `tool_choice` | 仅支持 `none` 和 `auto` |\n| `text.format.type` | 仅支持 `text` |",
        "operationId": "createResponseMiniMaxM31Flash",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResponsesRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple_text": {
                  "summary": "单轮文本对话",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "用一句话介绍杭州。"
                  }
                },
                "with_instructions": {
                  "summary": "使用系统指令",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "instructions": "你是一位严谨的技术文档工程师，回答保持简洁。",
                    "input": "解释什么是上下文缓存。"
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "多轮对话（输入项数组）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "帮我想三个产品名字。"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "云栖、启明、翎风。"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "第二个再给我五个近义词。"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "reasoning_effort": {
                  "summary": "设置思考深度（reasoning.effort）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "找出这个函数里的 bug：def add(a, b): return a - b",
                    "reasoning": {
                      "effort": "medium"
                    },
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "image_understanding": {
                  "summary": "图像理解 - 公网图片 URL",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "input_text",
                            "text": "描述这张图片的内容"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "input_image",
                            "image_url": "https://example.com/photo.jpg"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "video_understanding": {
                  "summary": "视频理解（input_video）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "input_text",
                            "text": "描述一下这段视频里发生了什么。"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "input_video",
                            "video_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4",
                              "fps": 1
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_output_tokens": 32768
                  }
                },
                "function_calling": {
                  "summary": "Function Calling 工具调用",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "杭州现在天气怎么样？",
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "查询指定城市的实时天气",
                        "parameters": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "城市名称"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "tool_choice": "auto"
                  }
                },
                "function_call_output": {
                  "summary": "回传函数执行结果（多轮工具调用）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": [
                      {
                        "type": "message",
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "杭州现在天气怎么样？"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_rs",
                        "type": "reasoning",
                        "status": "completed",
                        "summary": [],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "reasoning_text",
                            "text": "用户想查询杭州当前的天气，调用 get_weather。"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "resp_066b36619b147e32_fc_0",
                        "type": "function_call",
                        "status": "completed",
                        "call_id": "call_function_7k2m9x4q1w_1",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "arguments": "{\"city\": \"杭州\"}"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "function_call_output",
                        "call_id": "call_function_7k2m9x4q1w_1",
                        "output": "晴，22°C"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "查询指定城市的实时天气",
                        "parameters": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "城市名称"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "流式输出",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "input": "写一首关于秋天的短诗。",
                    "stream": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
